      "font_size": 1.0,
      "raw_text": "‡ † ‡ { NTRODUCTION aim at injecting malicious US Executive Order on Improving the [3]. RQ1.1 - What is a comprehensive list of general attack RQ1.2 - How to represent those attack vectors in a RQ2.1 - Which general safeguards exist, and which RQ2.2 - What is the utility and cost of those safeguards? RQ2.3 - Which safeguards are used by developers? A taxonomy of 107 unique attack vectors related to in terms of complete-",
